    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Place prepositions",
     "texto": [
      "**Dans** = inside. **Sur** = on, on top of. **Sous** = under.",
      "**Devant** = in front of. **Derrière** = behind. **Entre** = between.",
      "**À côté de** = next to. Before the masculine singular article **le**, **de + le** contract to **du**: **à côté du canapé**. Before the feminine **la**, **de la** stays: **à côté de la lampe**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
